      "mergedPostDetails": "If a user is not in the current instance or is not a Friend, the Trust rank string in the MM becomes \"User\". The icon color seems to reflect the rank correctly.\n\n# Repro steps:\n\n1. Join a public instance\n\n2. Open MM > Social > In Instance, and find a user with a non-User trust rank. Note the user name. (see the 1st image)\n\n3. Leave the instance.\n\n4. Open MM > Social > Recently Seen, and find the user and open the detail page\n\n5. You will see \"User\" in the \"TRUST RANK\" field (see the 2nd image)\n\nTested with Build 1750 (and open-beta 1766)\n\n# Repro steps with search:\n\n1. Open MM > Search\n\n2. Input and send a random short string to search for random people\n\n3. Select the Users tab and browse users' profiles.\n\n4. It will almost always show \"User\" despite shield icon color variance.\n\n5. Optionally, click the \"View On Website\" and browse the profile on the web. You'll see a different trust rank string",
      "mergedPostTitle": "The trust rank string becomes User if not in the instance",
