  "details": "Recently, I’ve noticed that some friends are shown as being User rank on their in-game profiles, even though they should appear as Trusted User.\n\n- On the website, these users correctly show as Trusted User.\n\n- In VRCX, they also show as Trusted User.\n\n- They have not changed their settings to appear as User.\n\nThe issue seems to resolve itself once you’re in the same instance as the affected user.\n\nI asked around and multiple friends confirmed these observations, pointing out this has been an issue for a while now.",
